# Restricts renv's dependency scan to the publication pipeline (code/)
# that renv.lock covers. In the full research repository (of which this
# published repository is a trimmed extract), these directories hold
# exploratory work, raw data, and an unrelated Python virtual
# environment that would otherwise slow the scan and pull in packages no
# publication script uses. Most of these directories are absent from
# this published repository; the entries are harmless no-ops here and
# retained for consistency with the source repository.
archives/
balancecompt/
data/
election_data/
make_parc_map.R
outputs/
phase_1/
phase_2/
phase3/
presentations/
scripts/
stats_des/
sumpowerdep.R
.venv/
